{"kind":"stack","id":"stack-sun-eyes","title":"Protecting our eyes from the sun","theme":{"background":"#fff8e1","foreground":"#263238","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Which part of the sun's light can damage your eyes?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Ultraviolet light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Warm light from the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Coloured light we can see","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Ultraviolet (UV) light"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"UV light is invisible light from the sun. It can harm your eyes and skin, even on cloudy days."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Can UV light reach your eyes on a cloudy day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Yes, it can","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"No, clouds block it completely","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Only at night","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which of these protects your eyes from the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Sunglasses with UV protection","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Looking straight at the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Squinting with no hat or glasses","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"What should you never do when the sun is shining?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Stare directly at the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Wear a wide-brimmed hat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Look at the sun through a solar viewer","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"It is a sunny day at break time. Your friend says, \"Let's look straight up at the sun!\" What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Say no and suggest a shady spot","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Look up at the sun with them","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Good choice! You keep your eyes safe and play in the shade together."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Looking straight at the sun can hurt your eyes. Next time, choose shade and wear sunglasses."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which is the best way to keep your eyes safe in strong sunshine?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Wear sunglasses and a hat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Rub your eyes often","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Close your eyes and keep looking up","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-t","content":"Sunglasses"},{"type":"text","id":"c10-e","content":"Sunglasses with UV protection block harmful light, so keep your eyes safe outdoors on sunny days."},{"type":"button","id":"c10-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the sun and eye safety quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. Always protect your eyes from the sun, and never look straight at it."}],"actions":[]}}
